OL,3,GNEWSAArts venue's revamp price tag
OL,4,Adoubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price to revamp an arts venue using
OL,7,Fpublic funding has doubled since
OL,8,Finitial plans were drawn up.
OL,10,FWork is expected to start on The
OL,11,FMaltings in Berwick-upon-Tweed in
OL,12,FNovember, subject to Northumberland
OL,13,FCounty Council agreeing to pay #7.5m
OL,14,Ftowards it.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
