OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArts venue's revamp price tag
OL,4,Adoubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen plans were drawn up for a complete
OL,7,Frebuild of the site in 2021, it was
OL,8,Fexpected to cost #17.7m. That initially
OL,9,Frose to #28m, with the price tag now
OL,10,Freaching #36m. The Borderlands
OL,11,FInclusive Growth Deal, funded by the UK
OL,12,Fand Scottish governments, has agreed to
OL,13,Fpay #28.5m towards it.
OL,15,FThe Conservative-led council said costs
OL,16,Fwere impacted by inflation and
OL,17,Fconflicts, which had driven up costs,
OL,18,Fincluding for the price of steel needed
OL,19,Ffor the work.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
